{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsealed: The Mare is a <strong>challenging</strong> psychological horror game blending <strong>tense gameplay</strong> with a dark, emotional story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Vera</strong>, caught between <strong>dreams</strong> and <strong>memories</strong>, you search for what should have been forgotten. As fragments of your family\u2019s tragedy surface, they poison your mind and intertwine with your <strong>memories</strong>, <strong>distorting the dream</strong> into something increasingly horrific. In this <strong>nightmare</strong>, everything feels connected - bound by <strong>guilt</strong>, <strong>sorrow</strong>, and something far <strong>darker</strong> you cannot yet comprehend. <br> <br>What begins as a search for answers slowly becomes a fight against a nightmare shaped by memory, loss, and something unsettlingly personal.<br><br><strong>---------</strong><br><br><u>The story and lore are discovered through\u00a0<strong>environmental clues, notes,</strong> and <strong>memories</strong>, inviting players to piece together the truth themselves rather than follow a traditional narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/73c0f92b53fb6df1fe3bb05cb10fe59f.avif?t=1774118066\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Estimated</strong>\u00a0<strong>Playtime:</strong>\u00a02<strong>-4h average</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A free demo is available if you want to experience the beginning of the nightmare first.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGING DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is <strong>intentionally challenging</strong> and does not rely on traditional guidance or hand-holding. Progress requires careful observation, experimentation, and <strong>learning from mistakes</strong>.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>three chapters</strong>, each adding new <strong>mechanics</strong> and <strong>increasing the challenge</strong>.<br>  <br><strong>FOCUS MEMORY</strong>    <br>Use <strong>Focus Memory</strong> to <strong>reveal</strong> <strong>hidden messages</strong>, <strong>clues</strong> and <strong>memories</strong> to <strong>change the environment</strong>, <strong>uncover hidden areas</strong>, and solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEALED DOORS</strong>   <br><strong>To advance, destroy memory-bound objects to break the seals holding doors shut.</strong>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>TOOLS &amp; ENCOUNTERS</strong>    <br>Use tools such as your <strong>flashlight</strong>, <strong>lighter</strong>, <strong>bulbs</strong>, and <strong>camera</strong> strategically as supplies become limited.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not liberation; it\u2019s merely another memory, sealed away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Chapters</strong>: Three chapters introducing new challenges, tools, and deeper layers of the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Memory</strong>: Reveal hidden clues and paths to progress deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental puzzles and riddles using logic and memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror</strong>: A mix of constant dread, scares, and unpredictable encounters that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound as Survival</strong>: Track hidden objects and dangers through subtle audio cues. Every sound matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Encounters</strong>: Survival demands patience, awareness, and smart decisions. Mistakes have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Nightmare</strong>: A story rooted in family tragedy, grief, and the lingering presence of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin in the basement memories, learning the core mechanics through slower, tense gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2 expands the nightmare deeper into the house, revealing more of its memories alongside new puzzles and gameplay interactions as the intensity grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Chapter 3, the Mare becomes unpredictable through a dynamic rage system, turning the final stretch into a tense confrontation where everything you've learned matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></u></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So it begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/80e31a9550a1dd4c89d5e307e769a1346f0e4308.jpg"},{"name":"Who's there?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/396c09e3eae767bce83bc55a8a22d66430760397.jpg"},{"name":"Lurker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/00ab2423ffa578a8aadd73d099681731376a734f.jpg"},{"name":"Efficient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/d2a689472870aefad2b1fb62b63df1ccdf9c7e1e.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/e6adf6f18adbb7d1e0c745aa97fbb9a763598e40.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Flame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/b76aae1827997de8fefdf1fc2cd47721daca9e69.jpg"},{"name":"Flasher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/1e192a8288732d6fd68b98404ca03f532c83c884.jpg"},{"name":"Lightbearer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/c5b44b6124606079bcdb7853f98e0d1be46ff4b4.jpg"},{"name":"Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/e1297063b3aeabfd4a481132bb5b1b342c1e6fa5.jpg"},{"name":"Nope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492710/8789faa0f2395a9e07e5941fd33d9ea313820389.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492710?t=1774118066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bd05f085812b478e60dcbea63a55e0d01c8fd5b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774118066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bb10f16674b8d781a540ac0e7fb130c8143f8996/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774118066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bb10f16674b8d781a540ac0e7fb130c8143f8996/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774118066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains intense psychological horror elements, including disturbing imagery, dark environments, and moments of extreme tension and fear. Some scenes depict injured characters and small amounts of blood in a non-graphic manner. The presence of supernatural entities (such as the Mare) and unsettling paranormal activity may be distressing for younger or sensitive players. Some scenes also include references to alcohol. There is no sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4245180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsealed: The Mare is a <strong>challenging</strong> psychological horror game blending <strong>tense gameplay</strong> with a dark, emotional story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Vera</strong>, caught between <strong>dreams</strong> and <strong>memories</strong>, you search for what should have been forgotten. As fragments of your family\u2019s tragedy surface, they poison your mind and intertwine with your <strong>memories</strong>, <strong>distorting the dream</strong> into something increasingly horrific. In this <strong>nightmare</strong>, everything feels connected - bound by <strong>guilt</strong>, <strong>sorrow</strong>, and something far <strong>darker</strong> you cannot yet comprehend. <br> <br>What begins as a search for answers slowly becomes a fight against a nightmare shaped by memory, loss, and something unsettlingly personal.<br><br><strong>---------</strong><br><br><u>The story and lore are discovered through\u00a0<strong>environmental clues, notes,</strong> and <strong>memories</strong>, inviting players to piece together the truth themselves rather than follow a traditional narrative.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/73c0f92b53fb6df1fe3bb05cb10fe59f.avif?t=1774118066\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Estimated</strong>\u00a0<strong>Playtime:</strong>\u00a02<strong>-4h average</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A free demo is available if you want to experience the beginning of the nightmare first.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGING DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is <strong>intentionally challenging</strong> and does not rely on traditional guidance or hand-holding. Progress requires careful observation, experimentation, and <strong>learning from mistakes</strong>.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through <strong>three chapters</strong>, each adding new <strong>mechanics</strong> and <strong>increasing the challenge</strong>.<br>  <br><strong>FOCUS MEMORY</strong>    <br>Use <strong>Focus Memory</strong> to <strong>reveal</strong> <strong>hidden messages</strong>, <strong>clues</strong> and <strong>memories</strong> to <strong>change the environment</strong>, <strong>uncover hidden areas</strong>, and solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong>.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/484079a2e3d2f222830c73678d51d8f9.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEALED DOORS</strong>   <br><strong>To advance, destroy memory-bound objects to break the seals holding doors shut.</strong>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/4aed230ea1d023f2863b448cf609fd13.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>TOOLS &amp; ENCOUNTERS</strong>    <br>Use tools such as your <strong>flashlight</strong>, <strong>lighter</strong>, <strong>bulbs</strong>, and <strong>camera</strong> strategically as supplies become limited.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.poster.avif?t=1774118066\" width=704 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.webm?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/extras/57bce400ff8426ada2bcd0e6a0593b7c.mp4?t=1774118066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is not liberation; it\u2019s merely another memory, sealed away.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Chapters</strong>: Three chapters introducing new challenges, tools, and deeper layers of the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus Memory</strong>: Reveal hidden clues and paths to progress deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong>: Solve environmental puzzles and riddles using logic and memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror</strong>: A mix of constant dread, scares, and unpredictable encounters that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound as Survival</strong>: Track hidden objects and dangers through subtle audio cues. Every sound matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Encounters</strong>: Survival demands patience, awareness, and smart decisions. Mistakes have consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Nightmare</strong>: A story rooted in family tragedy, grief, and the lingering presence of the past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin in the basement memories, learning the core mechanics through slower, tense gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2 expands the nightmare deeper into the house, revealing more of its memories alongside new puzzles and gameplay interactions as the intensity grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Chapter 3, the Mare becomes unpredictable through a dynamic rage system, turning the final stretch into a tense confrontation where everything you've learned matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></u></p>","developers":["Gamhalla"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/0c27e90a4f2816e405e8cb6c06533f41329075da/header.jpg?t=1774118066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1390322130/32445a13ecb7d47cb601171d2459dd50d25aa8a1/1773153296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773155298","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1390322130/32445a13ecb7d47cb601171d2459dd50d25aa8a1/1773153296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773155298","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492710/1390322130/32445a13ecb7d47cb601171d2459dd50d25aa8a1/1773153296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773155298","